/-!
# The least share of each class of each property

A class under its minimum fails its property: the generator no longer reaches the branch.

Each minimum is about a third of the share that a run of 1,000 cases showed.

Two runs were made, and the lesser share of the two is the one taken.

A property of fewer cases has a fifth, since its shares vary more.

A class that 1,000 cases reach in fewer than three of a hundred has no minimum.

The table is made from the report of a run, and is asked only of a run of 1,000 cases or more.

A short run has small cases, where a rare class is rarer.
-/

